284
00:13:46,021 --> 00:13:49,143
嗒嗒，那個拿着彩色密碼行事令的人

285
00:13:52,306 --> 00:13:53,027
Proof in blood

286
00:13:53,067 --> 00:13:54,628
evil is crazy

287
00:13:55,430 --> 00:13:57,753
It's important to
look your very best

288
00:13:57,793 --> 00:14:01,878
When you're
doing your very worst

289
00:14:01,918 --> 00:14:06,683
