And together we belong

392
00:18:39,196 --> 00:18:42,396
We wear our
patches upon our sashes

393
00:18:42,436 --> 00:18:43,196
And stand cute

394
00:18:43,236 --> 00:18:45,076
small and strong

395
00:18:45,195 --> 00:18:48,715
This is a
fireside girls song

396
00:18:49,595 --> 00:18:51,996
And it's not
too terribly long

397
00:18:52,437 --> 00:18:54,279
要我們為兵哥採集樹枝？

398
00:18:54,319 --> 00:18:55,880
